{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["ובנים לא יומתו על אבות — in a court of law, as written: ואת בני המכים לא המית, as written: לא יומתו וגו׳. But the Holy One, blessed be He, visits the iniquity of fathers upon children — when they hold fast to their fathers' deeds in their hands, as written: אבות יאכלו בוסר ושני בנים תקהינה — to destroy the fathers' inheritance, but not by means of a court of law."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:39:26.597791129Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}